    "raw_text": "Functionally Useless Unless You Give It Full Access To Your Entire Photo Livrary\n\nThe app intentionally does not allow you to access any of the functions unless you give it Full Access to all of your photos, even though selective photo access is a core feature of iOS. This was possible in previously versions, and given how long this has been reported as a bug, the intent is clearly that Google wants access to each and every one of your photos - almost certainly to expand their AI datasets. Scummy and morally reprehensible behavior.",
